    "agent_last_message": "Implemented in [output/main.py](/workspace/output/main.py).\n\nIt now:\n\n- Accepts `--input` and `--output` flags via CLI (`python main.py ...` when run from `output/`).\n- Uses only Python standard library (Python 3.11+ compatible).\n- Reads input as UTF-8 plain text with chunked streaming (scales to large files).\n- Computes:\n  - `lines` (spec-accurate for trailing/non-trailing newlines and empty files)\n  - `words` (non-whitespace sequences using exactly: space, tab, `\\n`, `\\r`, `\\f`, `\\v`)\n  - `characters` (byte count)\n  - `unique_words` (case-insensitive)\n  - `top_words` (up to 10, sorted by count desc then word asc)\n- Writes the required JSON object to `--output`.\n- Returns exit codes:\n  - `0` success\n  - `1` invalid invocation/input problems (missing/unknown args, unreadable input, malformed UTF-8, output path write errors)\n  - `2` unexpected internal error\n\nValidation run covered the spec edge cases (empty file, whitespace-only, newline variants, case-insensitive counting, punctuation behavior, tie sorting) plus error-path checks for malformed UTF-8, missing args, and unknown args.",
